0 -20 Td ( - Header with company name and logo placeholder.) Tj
0 -20 Td ( - Timestamp row showing generated timestamp.) Tj
0 -20 Td ( - Grid of metric cards with latest data: timestamp, type, building temp, setpoint, climate setting, fan setting, equipment status, studio, request expires, outside temp, condenser state, condenser minutes.) Tj
