0 -20 Td ( - Show or hide the history chart; displays condenser runtime total and estimated cost callout.) Tj
0 -20 Td ( - Chart controls toggle series \(set point, building temp, outside temp, equipment status, fan mode, combined\) plus autoplay toggle.) Tj
0 -20 Td ( - Chart.js canvas renders temperature and status history; history list can surface archived chart files.) Tj
0 -20 Td (Data and behavior:) Tj
0 -20 Td ( - Inline JSON payload supplies latest row, history series \(setpoint, actual, outside, fan, cooling, condenser minutes\), and archive metadata.) Tj
0 -20 Td ( - Uses inline data when available; can fetch archive JSON files from 'chart hist/<slug>.json' if needed.) Tj
0 -20 Td ( - Colors metric cards based on values \(temperature gradients, fan/cooling states\) and uses weather icons for outside conditions.) Tj
0 -20 Td ( - Autoplay cycles chart modes and pauses to show the logo; user interactions can open history files and archive months.) Tj
0 -20 Td ( - Estimates condenser runtime/cost and reports outside conditions and fan/cooling status.) Tj
